      "explanation": "increments the value of 'count'\r\n"
    },
    {
      "line_no": 7,
      "code": "          } while (count < 11); ",
      "explanation": "the body of the loop executes while count < 11.In our case it executes 10 times and prints 1,2,3,...9,10.\r\nOn the last step it prints 10, increments count to 11 and stops since 11 is no longer less than 11.\r\n"
